<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">常见问题</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('active')">
          养发皂适合什么发质？<span class="faq-toggle"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">适合各种发质，尤其推荐油性头皮、头屑反复、头皮瘙痒及掉发困扰人群使用。敏感头皮同样适用。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('active')">
          多久能看到效果？<span class="faq-toggle"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">一般连续使用2-4周可见头皮出油减少、头屑改善。长期使用（1-3个月）效果更稳定。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('active')">
          每天都可以用吗？<span class="faq-toggle"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">油性头皮可隔天使用，中性或干性头皮建议每周2-3次。根据自身头皮状态调整频率即可。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('active')">
          孕妇可以用吗？<span class="faq-toggle"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">本产品0硅油、0月桂醇、0防腐剂、0硫酸盐、0人工香精，配方温和。建议使用前咨询客服获取详细成分信息。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('active')">
          如何保存养发皂？<span class="faq-toggle"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">请置于干燥通风处保存，使用后放在沥水皂托上，避免长时间泡水可延长使用寿命。</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "FAQ" }]
}
{% endschema %}